   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "The imperfect of **avere** or **essere** + participle: **avevo mangiato** (I had eaten), **ero andato** (I had gone).",
      "The agreement of the participle is the same as in the passato prossimo: **Ero partita** (I had left, if you are a woman)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "To express an action earlier than another past action: **Quando sei arrivato, avevo già cenato** (when you arrived, I had already had dinner).",
      "**Già** (already) goes inside the compound form: **avevo già finito** (I had already finished)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
